 "subs": [
  {
   "text": "Two of the top reviews on\nthis Steam demo say it's a\ncrypto miner.",
   "start": 0.0,
   "duration": 4.121,
   "fontSize": 50,
   "y": 330,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "It isn't. But players are\nseeing ninety nine percent\nGPU load sitting in the\nmenu, doing nothing.",
   "start": 4.371,
   "duration": 5.871,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 330,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "Steam publishes the file\nlist for every demo, so I\nread this one. There's no\nminer in it.",
   "start": 10.492,
   "duration": 5.871,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 330,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "What's in it is the High\nDefinition Render\nPipeline. The heavy one,\nthat almost no small team\npicks.",
   "start": 16.613,
   "duration": 6.524,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 330,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "Plus, apparently, nothing\ncapping the frame rate. So\nyour fans spin up on a\nstill menu screen.",
   "start": 23.387,
   "duration": 5.975,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 330,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "Full teardown on the\nchannel. This is Demo Dip.",
   "start": 39.712,
   "duration": 2.997,
   "fontSize": 50,
   "y": 330,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  }
 ],
